WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:03.878
You should give up and call the nurse.
You won't make it beyond this point.

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:09.426
Hmm? Oh, yeah, the broom!

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:19.019
I don't mind some scratches! One or two
or three or four or five or six!

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:23.356
I'm going to get on that broom
no matter what!

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.872
You can't shake me off!

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:41.207
I'm going to hang on
until the end of the world!

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:45.211
Currently in first place is
the reliable cool beauty Diana!

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:46.796
Can she manage to hold on?

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.923
I'm worried about Akko.

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:51.593
Maybe she gave up and retired somewhere.

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:54.804
Someone else is gaining on her... Akko!

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:57.932
-Akko is flying on a broom!
-You're kidding.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:00.894
Akko?

00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:09.819
In third place is the dark horse,
the rebellious Amanda!

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:14.824
It's my broom. Give it back to me!

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:18.453
Hey, Akko!

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:27.879
Amanda is disqualified.
She failed to grab the baton!

00:01:27.962 --> 00:01:29.756
It's not a baton, but a doughnut!

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:37.472
What a development!
It's now a race between Diana and Akko!

00:01:40.016 --> 00:01:43.144
Amazing! Akko is flying on a broom!

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:45.146
She's just hanging on to it.

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:48.191
It's still amazing! Go, Akko!

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:56.282
They are neck and neck!
They are now in the homestretch!

00:01:56.366 --> 00:01:58.493
Who's going to win?

